P1-05 · Connection layer using MySqlConnector — evidence
Captured 2026-08-16 against the live host MariaDB (10.4.32-MariaDB, C:\xampp\mysql),
using the merch_api account created at P1-04.

=== MySqlConnector version pinned ===

src/Merchandising.Infrastructure/Merchandising.Infrastructure.vbproj:
  <PackageReference Include="MySqlConnector" Version="2.6.2" />

Chosen with Max 2026-08-16: latest stable on NuGet at the time, no preview/RC. Recorded in
docs/adr.md ADR-002, which is now ACCEPTED (previously PENDING on exactly this row).

Same pin repeated in src/tests/Merchandising.Tests.Integration/Merchandising.Tests.Integration.vbproj,
which needs MySqlConnection directly to assert session state in the test below.

=== Config file location and ACL ===

C:\ProgramData\MerchandisingSystem\config\database.json — outside the repository and outside
the published binaries, per plan.md P1-05 and CLAUDE.md section 4.

$ icacls "C:\ProgramData\MerchandisingSystem\config"
