Inheritance disabled ($acl.SetAccessRuleProtection($true, $false)); every inherited rule
removed before the three explicit ones above were added. No BUILTIN\Users, no Everyone, no
Authenticated Users entry. Documented for the installation guide in
docs/installation-guide.md ("Connection configuration file location and ACL" row).

